{"id":1767866,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-11T15:13:05.265Z","response":{"adult":true,"backdrop_path":"/n5g1tXpDg0Ix512Jdbd94raQmUw.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":878,"name":"Science Fiction"}],"homepage":"","id":1767866,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"The Tribunal","overview":"In the year 2149, Los Angeles is a ruined city, shattered by civil war. Governments have collapsed, replaced by corporate blocs that control territory, resources, and information. Justice is no longer blind - it’s televised, sponsored, and monetized, enforced by privatized law divisions known as The Tribunal. Crime hasn’t disappeared... it’s become entertainment. At the center of this brutal system is the face of modern justice, Kansas (Abigail Morris). As The Tribunal’s most famous bounty hunter, her efforts are always rewarded, with Tribunal Chief Gordon (Mick Blue) presenting her with his latest offering, male CORPS M57 (Parker Ambrose), sent to satisfy her every desire. Meanwhile, Tribunal analyst Kora Vance (Little Puck) uncovers an algorithm that doesn’t just predict crime - it manufactures it. When she steals crucial data and escapes, Gordon unleashes The Hunters and the ambitious rising star Bomber (Emma Rosie), turning the chase into a global spectacle...","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/qoHwoFBMgeTEeJxEu9ge87uMzm0.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":6112,"logo_path":"/wWrRC80656YYP4QqRqcUkdb99xN.png","name":"Digital Playground","origin_country":"US"}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2026-09-30","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"In Production","tagline":"In the future, crime pays. Blood pays more. Justice is the ultimate entertainment. \"The Tribunal\" - The number 1 judical reality show.","title":"The Tribunal","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"external_ids"